# Software Project Proposal

## Project Title
Process Model Management System

## Objective
Develop a web-based application to manage, visualize, and analyze software process models for educational and organizational use.

## Background
Software process models are essential for planning, monitoring, and improving software development activities. Currently, there is a lack of user-friendly tools for managing and visualizing these models, especially in academic settings.

## Scope
- User authentication and role management
- CRUD operations for process models
- Visualization of process flows
- Export and import functionality
- Reporting and analytics

## Technologies
- Frontend: React.js
- Backend: Node.js, Express.js
- Database: MongoDB
- Visualization: D3.js

